ecord on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and September to October came in under 90% of normal in 33 of them, more than any other pair. In 2025 on the middle, August to September came in at 49% of normal. So far in 2026 on the middle, January to February sits at 57% of normal. Every grid in the county had its driest year in 1988, with grid 22698 the lowest at 69%.</p>"}
